Phosphor BASIC 0.0.1 -- REPL. Variables and functions persist across lines.
Type a multi-line block and it waits for the terminator. Ctrl+Z then Enter to quit.
phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor> phosphor>      ...>      ...> phosphor>      ...> phosphor> phosphor> the variable survived: 5
phosphor> and so did the function: 42
phosphor>      ...>      ...> and a good block still works: 1
and a good block still works: 2
phosphor> 
